            "condition": "All planets between Rahu and Ketu",
            "axis_position": "Rahu to Ketu (clockwise or anti-clockwise)",
            "requirement": "All 7 planets (Sun, Moon, Mars, Mercury, Jupiter, Venus, Saturn) must be on one side"
          }
        ],
        
